<title>USA: TABLE-AirWays Corp June load factor rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-AirWays Corp June load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jun '97	 Jun '96	% Change</p>
<p>    Passengers Carried:92,093	   91,378	 +  .8 %</p>
<p>    ASMs (000):	 113,189	  114,574	 - 1.2 %</p>
<p>    RPMs (000):	  78,564	   79,319	 -  .9 %</p>
<p>    Load Factor:    69.4 %	   69.2 %	 +  .2 pts.</p>
<p>							    Year-to-Date</p>
<p>					 6 months ended Jun 30, 1997</p>
<p>				 YTD97	   YTD96	% Change</p>
<p>    Passengers Carried 567,738	 567,491	+  .04 %</p>
<p>    ASMs (000):	  710,163	 728,157	-  2.5 %</p>
<p>    RPMs (000):	  479,649	 498,966	-  3.9 %</p>
<p>    Load Factor:	 67.5 %	  68.5 %	1.0 pts.</p>
<p>Note: The results are for AirWays jet subsidiary, AirTran Airways.</p>
</text>
